I have a Logitech BRIO web camera attached to this machine via USB. It works fine - both camera and microphone - but I don't have a way to access settings that would have been available on say a mac or windows, since there are no proprietary drivers: we just get the vanilla USB profiles. Can you help me investigate what additional profiles the camera has and how to access them? The ideal solution would be to be able to write an app that allowed me to change the settings, if possible.

